                                "sense_id": "520f43ff-5813-3966-b41c-81d6c1913dda",
                                "text": "Most of Æsopes fables have divers senses, and severall interpretations: Those which Mythologize them, chuse some kinde of colour well-suting with the fable; but for the most part, it is no more than the first and superficiall glosse[…]."
